**packages/types/src/objectql.ts:506**
* `ObjectGridSchema.singleClickEdit` is documented as `@default false`, but ObjectGrid currently passes `schema.singleClickEdit ?? true` down to the data-table. Please align the JSDoc default with the actual runtime default (or change the runtime default) to avoid misleading API docs.
```
  /**
   * Enable single-click editing mode
   * When true with editable, clicking a cell enters edit mode (instead of double-click)
   * @default false
   */
  singleClickEdit?: boolean;
```
